Amplifier probe: map single pages; it used up io_map's 8 MB and the GPU probe panicked.

all18 panic: kmem_alloc(io_submap, 589824 = 0x90000, ...) failed with 3 (KERN_NO_SPACE) in
ml_io_map(0x05900000, 0x90000) of the GPU probe. io_submap is 8 MB on arm and its maps are never
given back; the probe mapped every tile from its base up to the pin (3 x 107 pages for GPIO106),
seven neighbours more in 0137, and 512 KB of GCC. Now one page per pin look and two GCC pages.

